Herdr Local OpenLive reuses selected source from Yashwanth Reddy Katipally's
OpenLive repository at commit 849173cd1c8c17a95d600b17b428c301722bf5df.
OpenLive is licensed under the MIT License. The exact upstream license is copied
to dist/OPENLIVE-LICENSE during each verified build.

The runtime executes OpenLive's models.worker.ts directly in a sandboxed hidden
Electron renderer and uses its provider-neutral streamProvider implementation.
